==English==
{{was wotd|2025|February|27}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{compound|en|{{l|mul|1}}|{{l|mul|0}}|{{l|mul|1}}}}, from the method of numbering courses in United States colleges, the initial or introductory course commonly being numbered “101”; for example, “Biology 101”.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=adj|id=1006094113|date=July 2023|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=adj|us=1}}</ref>

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|en|/ˌwʌnəʊˈwʌn/|a=RP}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˌwʌnˌoʊˈwʌn/|a=GA}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-101.ogg|a=GA}}
* {{rhymes|en|ʌn|s=3}}

